{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "5_02_026_23_5_02_026_23",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:9b00fe8cbfbc1e46993a76d2222d36b8996a08c2a394238ee999c0ed63dda0f9",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:5_02_026_23_5_02_026_23:5_02_026_23:cmd-000014:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:02d351b7d52965f1cec19f70eb96a5ec7f53e6f7426dd069f2901368f178730d",
      "text": "●●●●●●●●●●番长，辛苦了。\n肚子会不会稍微有点饿了？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_026_23_5_02_026_23:5_02_026_23:cmd-000023:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d905c536c0a0bb689454d423a58d0502016e0cdc6e9120d9b9f949fcf7d3908a",
      "text": "作为白色情人节的回礼，我做了一点点心。\n不嫌弃的话就尝尝吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_026_23_5_02_026_23:5_02_026_23:cmd-000025:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f6b11f00b3bfa1cac8ce6a737c5daa5bc133022e788d2df9ad6425f87b2216c6",
      "text": "是玄武先生亲手做的吗？\n看起来非常好吃呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_026_23_5_02_026_23:5_02_026_23:cmd-000030:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e47de9b774a6a252a4bf71ef67138713d5a0d0e0f7bb38ff0b7f83bbdad695c2",
      "text": "嗯。之前你不是陪我\n去采购过一次玩具吗。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_026_23_5_02_026_23:5_02_026_23:cmd-000033:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1421c22ed9c3d2972c33a1a6a5225659c333bad20bf9b8b3dddf7f9dd45b8d13",
      "text": "正好有了使用那时看到的料理玩具的机会。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_026_23_5_02_026_23:5_02_026_23:cmd-000039:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4741bf2a79033c2a45f016004f8c21a76d67cc4aac2028aaedda37faaa3b2d9a",
      "text": "那玩意儿意外地不容小觑。虽说是玩具，\n却发现能做出相当地道的点心来。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_026_23_5_02_026_23:5_02_026_23:cmd-000043:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c0e91115297948214baeda8aa52386afc5e2ff43104ed8b1596d16eaee063534",
      "text": "这次我就是用它试着做了点心。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_026_23_5_02_026_23:5_02_026_23:cmd-000047:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:236017957eed3b3a54af6a081537ea1a99c925f56dc61eb50d2886ebec5946ea",
      "text": "为了能送出一份不输给番长那份热烈心意的礼物，\n我全心全意倾注了心血。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_026_23_5_02_026_23:5_02_026_23:cmd-000051:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:de99c59f9fc5cfe71043346aa43047a9d2feba4bcf1524529a8e5f15e15deeb7",
      "text": "饱含着如此心意的礼物，\n非常感谢。我马上就尝尝看！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_026_23_5_02_026_23:5_02_026_23:cmd-000056:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b23cd32c82e049e945b6dc7ecac64eba59ee602d60e6f9c10b75da98546eb4a1",
      "text": "嗯。慢慢品尝吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
